WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.060
Authentication establishes identity; authorization controls actions.

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:13.160
Safe Node.js authentication starts with clear identity types and trust boundaries before choosing libraries or writing middleware.

3
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.820
Store password verifiers safely.

4
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.360
Defend login and recovery flows against abuse.

5
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:27.380
Protect browser sessions with secure cookies, HTTPS, lifecycle controls, and CSRF defenses where appropriate.

6
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.360
Validate tokens completely before trusting claims.

7
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:36.220
Use OAuth and OpenID Connect through well-maintained libraries and clear provider configuration.

8
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.620
Treat MFA and account recovery as high-risk lifecycle features, not as side screens.

9
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:46.280
Enforce authentication server-side through consistent middleware or guards.

10
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:55.980
Protect authentication secrets and avoid leaking tokens through logs, URLs, repositories, support artifacts, or client-side code.

11
00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:03.440
Monitor authentication events and review authentication changes during pull requests, CI/CD, and deployment review.

12
00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:08.980
Authentication work spans code, configuration, operations, and incident response.

13
00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.780
A practical first week plan is enough to start improving.

14
00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:24.400
Inventory authentication flows, including login, logout, password reset, MFA reset, token refresh, service credentials, and admin authentication.

15
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.220
Review password hashing settings and libraries.

16
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:31.160
Check cookie attributes and HTTPS assumptions.

17
00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:38.220
Validate JWT handling against issuer, audience, signature, expiration, and intended use.

18
00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.160
Identify unprotected routes.

19
00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.180
Review OAuth configuration.

20
00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:43.640
Protect secrets.

21
00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.820
Remove token logging.

22
00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.480
Add monitoring for high-risk events.
